The '''Esports World Cup''' is a tournament series that was announced in late 2023, building off the previously established '''Gamers8''' series. '''Warzone''' was announced as part of the line-up on June 13, 2024. Alongside MWIII, Call of Duty is the last game to be announced for EWC.<ref name="EWC PUBG">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/EWC_EN/status/1800958748825182446|title=San Francisco, pick up your loadouts! 🎖️🌉|date=2024-07-13|author=Esports World Cup|language={{FlagNoLink|usuk}} English}}</ref>
:''See [https://liquipedia.net/esports/Esports_World_Cup/2024 here] to read about the Esports World Cup 2024, the Calendar, the Club Standings and more.''

