===Format===
<big>'''''All matches are played on Rebirth Island (Resurgence).</big>
* '''Solo Seeding Stage'''
** All teams compete as Solos, each team fields 2 players
** 6 Matches, each group played 2 matches total
** Combined score of each player in each team used to determine group stage seeding
* '''Group Stage'''
** 21 teams split into 3 groups
** Round Robin, each group played 8 matches total
** Top 14 advances
* '''Finals'''
** 8 Matches

