===Format===
<big>'''''All matches are played on Resurgence.</big>
* '''Group Stage'''
** 21 teams split into 3 groups of 7 teams
** Top 7 advances
** Remaining proceed to Last Chance
* '''Last Chance'''
** 14 teams
** Top 7 advances
* '''Finals'''
** '''Match Point format'''
*** There is no match limit in the Finals.
*** There is no limit to number of teams who can be '''"Match Point Eligible"'''.
*** Once a team reaches '''135''' points, That team gained '''Match Point''' status from the next match onwards.
*** The first team under the '''"Match Point"''' status to win a match will be declared the 2025 EWC Warzone Champions.''
** After the winner/champion is declared, the rest of the standings are determined through points

