===Format===
*'''Group Stage''' - August 5 - 7, 2026
**16 teams split into 2 GSL Groups of 8.
*** All matches are {{Abbr/Bo5}}.
**Top 4 Teams per group - 8 in total - advance to the [[#Playoffs|Playoffs]].
*'''Playoffs''' - August 8 - 9, 2026
**Single Elimination Bracket.
***Upper Bracket Teams will be drawn randomly against a Lower Bracket Team. Teams from the same Group can not play against each other.
***All matches ''(excl. Grand Finals)'' are {{Abbr/Bo7}}.
**** Grand Finals is a {{Abbr/Bo9}}.

